    "title": "Fairview Park resident celebrates $200,000 Cash Explosion win after second appearance on the show - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hellen Patton ,\n4 hours ago Fairview Park, Ohio – A Fairview Park resident is celebrating a life-changing moment after returning to the Ohio Lottery’s popular Cash Explosion television game and walking away with a major prize. Mike Morrell won a total of $200,000 during his second appearance on the show, a victory that came at a particularly meaningful time as he had just retired. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
